.TH RITCHIE-INTERLOCK 2 "FEBRUARY 2026" "QuanuX Biological Sovereignty" "QuanuX System Manual"
.SH NAME
ritchie-interlock \- The Cellular Invariants and Immune System Thresholds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <quanux/sovereign_state.hpp>
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBRitchie Interlock\fR is the absolute immune response governing the QuanuX cell. It dictates the deterministic laws of survival mapped across the L3 cache boundary (`SovereignState`).
.SH THE CELLULAR INVARIANTS (FSM TIES)
The cell's health is strictly bound to its physical state:
.TP
.BR STATE_VOID\ (0)
The resting primordial state. The memory segment is zeroed.
.TP
.BR STATE_VIGIL\ (1)
The active listening state. The cell is exposed to data receptors but uncommitted to action. `current_position == 0`.
.TP
.BR STATE_ENGAGED\ (2)
The execution state. The cell has extended its boundaries. `ABS(current_position) <= position_limit_max`. Unhedged delta tolerance is rigidly enforced.
.TP
.BR STATE_HEDGE\ (3)
The defensive contraction. Position scalars must be strictly negative. Action attempting to add risk results in an immediate immune response.
.TP
.BR STATE_HALT\ (4)
Apoptosis. The cell shuts down metabolic function. `risk_interlock == 1`.
.SH RECEPTOR THRESHOLDS
The \fBQuanuX-Sentinel\fR monitors the 64-byte structural constraints constantly. 
These are the hard-coded logic gates ensuring the Nucleus remains healthy. If a threshold is violently crossed, the cell terminates its network connections instantly without waiting on standard OS context switching mechanisms.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR quanux-cell (7)
.SH AUTHORS
Built by the QuanuX Foundation.
.SH THE LAW OF NON-INTERFERENCE (THE GHOST HAND-OFF)
To preserve the 16-cycle Silence of the Aether as defined by \fBquanux-aether(7)\fR, the cell enforces \fBThe Law of Non-Interference\fR. 

No organelle may perform a memory-copy (`memcpy()`) of market data ingested by the Synapse. The physical photon array remains rigidly locked where the Solarflare NIC DMA sequence deposited it. The Nucleus merely updates its pointer geometry to peer into the \fBquanux-shm(4)\fR Cytoplasm. Memory moves result in immediate apoptoic jitter.

.SH THE LAW OF PRE-CALCULATION
To preserve zero-copy lethality on the Kinetic Egress, the cell must enforce \fBThe Law of Pre-Calculation\fR. 

No mathematical operations—including packet construction, sequence numbering, risk multiplication, or checksum generation—may occur after the Alpha Trigger has fired. Every component of the outbound \fBef_vi\fR execution frame must be pre-calculated and templated into the \fBquanux-shm\fR Cytoplasm whilst the cell rests in \fBSTATE_VIGIL\fR (1). 

When the decision is made, the Nucleus merely sets the hardware "Intent Bit," dropping the DMA pointer onto the wire. Attempting to execute logic during the Strike state results in an immediate apoptoic jitter.
